+4. `kompile semantic.k --backend llvm --main-module SEMANTIC --syntax-module MPY-SYNTAX --output-definition semantic-llvm-kompiled -Wno unused-symbol -Wno unused-var`
+   - Exit 0; `04-kompile-semantic-llvm.log`.
